      "writtenOn": "2025-04-11T14:06:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We use `\u0027skip_merge_script\u0027: True,` in chrome.gpu.fyi waterfall, can that work?\nI remember we used it for Android tests and they were sharded.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 20,
