      },
      "lineNbr": 20,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000193
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-04-11T20:01:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It looks like use of that has been largely removed? The only reference to `merge` in `chromium.gpu.fyi.star` is `use_android_merge_script_by_default`, which doesn\u0027t fully remove merging. The generated JSON still shows them [using](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:infra/config/generated/builders/ci/Android%20FYI%20Release%20%28Pixel%204%29/targets/chromium.gpu.fyi.json;l\u003d41) the `standard_gtest_merge.py` script.\n\nThe only uses of `skip_merge_script` left that I\u0027m seeing are for Skylab builders. [Documentation](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:testing/buildbot/README.md;l\u003d445?q\u003d-file:%5Eout%20-file:%5Egen%20skip_merge_script%20-file:third_party%2Fangle%20-file_third_party%2Fdawn) also indicates that further use of `skip_merge_script` is discouraged.",
      "parentUuid": "e5d4f96e_9830317e",
